### IncidentReport API Tests

### Get all incident reports
GET https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport
Accept: application/json

### Get incident report by ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport/1
Accept: application/json

### Get incident reports by nurse ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport/nurse/1
Accept: application/json

### Get incident reports by student ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport/student/1
Accept: application/json

### Create new incident report
POST https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "nurseId": 1,
  "date": "2024-01-15T10:30:00",
  "type": "Injury",
  "description": "Student fell during recess and scraped knee",
  "actionTaken": "Cleaned wound and applied bandage"
}

### Update incident report
PUT https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-01-15T10:30:00",
  "type": "Injury",
  "description": "Student fell during recess and scraped knee - updated description",
  "actionTaken": "Cleaned wound, applied bandage, and monitored for infection"
}

### Delete incident report
DELETE https://localhost:7001/api/IncidentReport/1

### HealthCheck API Tests

### Get all health checks
GET https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck
Accept: application/json

### Get health check by ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck/1
Accept: application/json

### Get health checks by student ID
GET https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck/student/1
Accept: application/json

### Create new health check
POST https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": 1,
  "date": "2024-01-15T09:00:00",
  "checkType": "Vision Screening",
  "results": "Normal vision in both eyes",
  "notes": "Student passed vision screening with no issues"
}

### Update health check
PUT https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2024-01-15T09:00:00",
  "checkType": "Vision Screening",
  "results": "Normal vision in both eyes - 20/20",
  "notes": "Student passed vision screening with excellent results"
}

### Delete health check
DELETE https://localhost:7001/api/HealthCheck/1 